   <text>
      <body>
            <pb facs="lib:108"/>
            <lb facs="lib:108.1"/>(77)
            <lb facs="lib:108.2"/>Copy of a Letter to Mr Ro-
            <lb facs="lib:108.3"/>vert Forbes at My Lady
            <lb facs="lib:108.4"/>Bruce's Lodgings Leith.
            <lb facs="lib:108.5"/>Dr Sir Wishing from my whole
            <lb facs="lib:108.6"/>Heart, that these may find you &amp;
            <lb facs="lib:108.7"/>all your Leith Friends in good
            <lb facs="lib:108.8"/>Health, I have had a little bit
            <lb facs="lib:108.9"/>Fever some Days past; but, God
            <lb facs="lib:108.10"/>be blessed, I am now in good
            <lb facs="lib:108.11"/>Health, Heart &amp; Spirits; and
            <lb facs="lib:108.12"/>if it is my Fate to goe to the
            <lb facs="lib:108.13"/>Scaffold, I dare say, that I'll
            <lb facs="lib:108.14"/>goe to Death, as a Christian &amp;
            <lb facs="lib:108.15"/>a Man of Honour ought to do.
            <lb facs="lib:108.16"/>But it is possible, that a broken
            <lb facs="lib:108.17"/>ill-usd Major may be a Colo-
            <lb facs="lib:108.18"/>nel before he dies. You'll
            <lb facs="lib:108.19"/>make my Compliments to My
            <lb facs="lib:108.20"/>Lady Bruce, Mr Clerks Family,
            <lb facs="lib:108.21"/>but Miss Mally in particular, &amp;
            <lb facs="lib:108.22"/>the rest of the honest Folks in
            <lb facs="lib:108.23"/>that City, &amp; accept of the same
            <lb facs="lib:108.24"/>from him, who is with the greatest
            <lb facs="lib:108.25"/>Sincerety, affection &amp; Esteem,
            <lb facs="lib:108.27"/>Castle Caslisle
            <lb facs="lib:108.26"/>My Dr Sir
            <lb facs="lib:108.28"/>Sept 20th, Your most affte &amp; obedient Serv
            <lb facs="lib:108.29"/>while Donald MacDonell
            <lb facs="lib:108.30"/>1746
            <lb facs="lib:108.31"/>P-S
            <pb facs="lib:109"/>
            <lb facs="lib:109.1"/>(78)
            <lb facs="lib:109.2"/>P-S: I wrote you &amp; Mr Moir
            <lb facs="lib:109.3"/>a joint Letter about ten days agoe.
      </body>
